Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `#{count}` pastes a template binding outside a template
  --> tests/ui/template_paste_outside_template.jet:5:11
    |
  5 |     print(#{count})
    |           ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Only a derive or marker template splices a binding's name into the code it generates
 Fix: Write the name itself, or move this code into a derive or marker template
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
